<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, OCT 15.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, OCT 15.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Oct 15	Oct 14	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  240.400     239.730     237.040    1.42 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  300.180     300.300     303.640   -1.14 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.400     156.585     165.490   -5.49 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.220	46.252	48.410   -4.52 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  380.240     378.460     366.280    3.81 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.420     139.600     147.886   -5.72 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.746	15.748	14.975    5.15 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  214.210     214.510     230.135   -6.92 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.861	 1.862	 1.939   -4.02 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.548	 1.548	 1.575   -1.71 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  190.080     191.050     206.030   -7.74 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
